WEBVTT

00:31.630 --> 00:35.180
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.200 --> 00:38.580
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.850 --> 00:44.820
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.980 --> 00:49.610
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.630 --> 00:53.140
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.160 --> 00:56.650
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.670 --> 01:00.180
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.200 --> 01:06.260
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.520 --> 01:23.800
Si Jin

01:23.820 --> 01:28.320
Episode 27

01:30.960 --> 01:33.640
(Jiang Si, daughter of Earl Dongping)

01:36.570 --> 01:38.220
Why would Consort Xian

01:38.570 --> 01:39.660
invite a girl

01:39.660 --> 01:41.440
like Jiang Si?

01:41.460 --> 01:42.900
You didn't invite her?

01:42.900 --> 01:44.930
Why would I invite her?

01:45.460 --> 01:48.280
Family background and character

01:48.300 --> 01:50.060
matter far more than looks.

01:50.930 --> 01:53.550
It seems Consort Xian

01:53.570 --> 01:55.240
intends to find Prince Yan

01:55.260 --> 01:57.060
a wife of low birth.

01:57.930 --> 02:00.250
But she shouldn't have picked

02:00.250 --> 02:02.720
a girl who was rejected
by a Duke's family.

02:02.740 --> 02:05.840
They all say Consort Xian

02:05.860 --> 02:08.090
is indifferent to Prince Yan.

02:08.250 --> 02:10.850
As we can see, it's true.

02:18.730 --> 02:21.930
Does Consort Zhuang want

02:21.930 --> 02:24.530
to take in a stunning concubine
for Prince Shu?

02:25.250 --> 02:26.850
But concubines

02:27.300 --> 02:30.030
have their own selection process.

02:30.050 --> 02:31.790
They should never be mixed

02:31.810 --> 02:33.780
with the candidates for the wives.

02:40.810 --> 02:42.970
At the blossom-viewing banquet
that year,

02:43.810 --> 02:45.050
I gave peonies

02:45.050 --> 02:47.370
to six young ladies,

02:47.930 --> 02:50.020
but in my heart, I only wanted

02:50.180 --> 02:52.130
to give one to Qingrong.

02:52.330 --> 02:54.910
Back then, the late Empress and you

02:54.930 --> 02:57.340
were a match made in heaven.

02:57.650 --> 02:59.650
Everyone envied you.

03:01.580 --> 03:03.000
In the blink of an eye,

03:03.020 --> 03:05.090
Qingrong has been gone for years.

03:05.460 --> 03:06.910
Your Majesty,

03:06.930 --> 03:09.350
Yang Nianzhi from the Astronomy
requests an audience.

03:09.370 --> 03:10.970
Let him in.

03:13.330 --> 03:14.510
Greetings, Your Majesty.

03:14.530 --> 03:16.560
Greetings, Your Highness.

03:16.580 --> 03:18.230
Before the Princes' weddings,

03:18.250 --> 03:19.300
Directorate of Astronomy

03:19.300 --> 03:22.370
should customarily predict
marriage compatibility.

03:23.050 --> 03:24.330
Here are the marriage fortunes

03:24.330 --> 03:26.500
of Prince Shu and Prince Yan.

03:26.620 --> 03:28.220
Please have a look.

03:28.420 --> 03:31.070
Prince Yan's fate is marked
by misfortune,

03:31.090 --> 03:33.180
already deemed inauspicious.

03:33.210 --> 03:34.370
He must never

03:34.370 --> 03:36.970
(Yang Nianzhi, Supervisor)
marry someone

03:37.330 --> 03:38.720
with a similarly ill-fated destiny.

03:38.740 --> 03:40.750
It'd bring calamity
to the nation and the family.

03:40.770 --> 03:42.750
It could spell disaster for Dazhou.

03:42.770 --> 03:44.960
Yet Prince Yan once saved my life

03:44.980 --> 03:46.790
in a time of crisis.

03:46.810 --> 03:48.620
Supervisor Yang, why won't you

03:48.620 --> 03:49.740
let go of that omen?

03:49.740 --> 03:51.560
- But...
- Supervisor Yang,

03:51.580 --> 03:53.030
must a Prince

03:53.050 --> 03:55.510
be bound

03:55.530 --> 03:56.490
by the Astronomy

03:56.490 --> 03:58.780
from birth to marriage?

03:59.860 --> 04:01.750
His Majesty has promised

04:01.770 --> 04:04.000
Prince Yan that he may choose
a bride that he likes.

04:04.020 --> 04:05.780
There is no need

04:05.780 --> 04:07.160
for your baseless talk.

04:07.180 --> 04:07.830
Your Highness,

04:07.830 --> 04:10.050
ensuring that everything
aligns with the will of heaven

04:10.050 --> 04:12.080
is our duty in the Astronomy.

04:12.100 --> 04:13.620
How is that coercion?

04:13.620 --> 04:14.660
You...

04:14.660 --> 04:16.840
All our predictions are based

04:16.860 --> 04:19.020
on extensive calculations.

04:19.540 --> 04:21.380
They are not baseless.

04:24.010 --> 04:25.100
Enough.

04:25.100 --> 04:27.850
Supervisor Yang is only
fulfilling his duty.

04:29.860 --> 04:31.610
Your Majesty, rest assured.

04:31.690 --> 04:34.280
Every lady invited here

04:34.300 --> 04:36.160
is from a distinguished family.

04:36.180 --> 04:38.850
They won't bear an ill-fated destiny.

04:38.930 --> 04:40.530
Forget it.

04:40.620 --> 04:41.870
Supervisor Yang.

04:41.890 --> 04:42.780
Yes.

04:42.780 --> 04:44.350
After the banquet,

04:44.370 --> 04:45.990
look into the noble ladies

04:46.010 --> 04:48.160
who received flowers.

04:48.180 --> 04:49.780
Your Majesty, you're wise.

04:49.930 --> 04:52.380
I shall take my leave.

05:11.700 --> 05:13.430
♪ From place to place ♪

05:13.430 --> 05:18.370
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

05:18.740 --> 05:21.120
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

05:21.120 --> 05:25.350
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

05:26.060 --> 05:28.460
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

05:28.480 --> 05:32.140
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall
and take root ♪

05:32.160 --> 05:35.500
♪ Growing between us ♪

05:35.520 --> 05:38.320
(Xu Hour)

05:39.370 --> 05:41.020
The time has come.

05:42.070 --> 05:46.100
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

05:46.300 --> 05:48.020
(In case...)

05:53.090 --> 05:55.020
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

05:55.020 --> 06:02.520
♪ We will see flowers
fill the city again ♪

06:08.340 --> 06:11.650
His Majesty and the Grand Princess
have arrived.

06:21.570 --> 06:23.340
Greetings, Your Majesty.

06:23.340 --> 06:26.340
Greetings, Your Highness.

06:28.010 --> 06:29.610
Rise.

06:31.250 --> 06:33.290
Thank you, Your Majesty.

06:43.890 --> 06:44.810
Your Majesty,

06:44.810 --> 06:46.870
these are the paintings by the ladies.

06:46.890 --> 06:48.780
Please take a look.

06:51.220 --> 06:54.570
Bright and elegant,
as if carrying fragrance.

06:54.590 --> 06:55.470
Your Majesty,

06:55.470 --> 06:56.860
this painting, Better than Spring,

06:56.860 --> 06:59.530
is by Princess Mingyue.

07:01.300 --> 07:02.900
Not bad.

07:03.220 --> 07:05.260
It exudes wealth and grandeur.

07:05.980 --> 07:08.220
Mingyue paints with a refined style.

07:08.240 --> 07:09.100
Reward.

07:09.100 --> 07:10.890
His Majesty praises Better than Spring

07:10.890 --> 07:13.180
for its refined style.

07:13.180 --> 07:15.940
Princess Mingyue is bestowed
a jade bracelet.

07:20.130 --> 07:21.730
Thank you, Your Majesty.

07:22.100 --> 07:23.700
Thank you, Your Majesty.

07:28.490 --> 07:30.320
Jiang Si, did you see that?

07:30.340 --> 07:32.080
When I wish to win,

07:32.100 --> 07:33.730
I never lose.

07:39.250 --> 07:40.980
This painting, Grace by the Water,

07:40.980 --> 07:43.720
is by Kou Lingbo
from the Grand Preceptor's family.

07:43.740 --> 07:46.160
It is elegant and otherworldly.

07:46.180 --> 07:48.990
As expected of the Grand Preceptor's
granddaughter.

07:49.010 --> 07:50.540
This painting, Gentle Breeze,

07:50.540 --> 07:53.940
is by Jiang Si
from Earl Dongping's family.

07:55.660 --> 07:57.260
This...

08:06.180 --> 08:07.780
What does that mean?

08:08.050 --> 08:09.650
This...

08:10.690 --> 08:13.820
Everyone can be bad at painting,

08:14.130 --> 08:15.910
but Jiang Si

08:15.930 --> 08:18.260
submitted a blank sheet of paper.

08:18.660 --> 08:21.080
This is contempt
for the imperial family.

08:21.100 --> 08:22.560
Who is Jiang Si?

08:22.580 --> 08:23.620
Summon her.

08:23.620 --> 08:25.150
By His Majesty's order,

08:25.170 --> 08:29.180
Jiang Si of Earl Dongping's family
is summoned.

08:30.650 --> 08:31.820
What about me?

08:31.820 --> 08:33.230
Your Grace,

08:33.250 --> 08:35.250
His Majesty only summoned Jiang Si.

08:36.720 --> 08:38.400
I'm Jiang Si
from Earl Dongping's family.

08:38.410 --> 08:40.010
Greetings, Your Majesty.

08:40.370 --> 08:41.970
Jiang Si.

08:42.620 --> 08:44.040
This is a contest of skill.

08:44.060 --> 08:46.540
How dare you submit a blank scroll?

08:46.980 --> 08:48.440
Your Majesty,

08:48.460 --> 08:50.820
I spent two hours painting.

08:50.860 --> 08:52.660
How could it be blank?

08:52.700 --> 08:53.650
Mr. Sun,

08:53.650 --> 08:55.270
when you inspected earlier,

08:55.290 --> 08:56.870
you saw me painting.

08:56.890 --> 08:58.440
Jiang Si, how dare you.

08:58.460 --> 09:00.650
Not only did you submit a blank scroll,

09:00.650 --> 09:02.580
but you also spouted nonsense.

09:02.820 --> 09:04.230
Your Majesty,

09:04.250 --> 09:06.870
after an hour has passed,

09:06.890 --> 09:09.600
I still haven't seen Jiang Si
pick up her brush.

09:09.620 --> 09:11.440
It wasn't until the second hour

09:11.460 --> 09:14.320
that I saw her take the brush

09:14.340 --> 09:16.040
and pretend to paint.

09:16.060 --> 09:17.770
Show her the painting.

09:17.820 --> 09:19.420
Yes.

09:39.370 --> 09:40.290
What are you doing?

09:40.290 --> 09:42.350
Why stand out in this situation?

09:42.370 --> 09:43.220
Your Majesty,

09:43.220 --> 09:44.860
I saw Jiang Si pick up the brush

09:44.860 --> 09:46.870
and paint just now.

09:46.890 --> 09:49.560
The 7th Prince was far
from the painting area.

09:49.580 --> 09:51.200
How could you see clearly?

09:51.220 --> 09:53.130
Jiang Si came here for the banquet.

09:53.220 --> 09:54.820
Why would she submit a blank scroll?

09:54.820 --> 09:56.920
Is she waiting for you to condemn her?

09:56.940 --> 09:58.230
There must be something fishy.

09:58.250 --> 09:59.850
Father, please judge wisely.

10:00.580 --> 10:02.340
The evidence is clear.

10:02.740 --> 10:04.420
What else could it be?

10:04.530 --> 10:06.560
She has no talent or skill.

10:06.580 --> 10:08.920
She couldn't paint,
so she submitted a blank scroll.

10:08.940 --> 10:10.390
Your Majesty,

10:10.410 --> 10:13.920
I indeed painted this,

10:13.940 --> 10:15.850
but it isn't blank.

10:15.980 --> 10:17.130
Could it be

10:17.130 --> 10:19.080
that no one else has eyes but you?

10:19.100 --> 10:21.340
The smell of this paper is strange.

10:23.170 --> 10:25.220
There is a grassy scent on it.

10:25.290 --> 10:27.600
I've studied plants since I was young.

10:27.620 --> 10:29.080
There's a plant

10:29.100 --> 10:30.700
called Traceless Grass.

10:30.890 --> 10:32.130
When its juice

10:32.130 --> 10:33.350
is mixed with ink,

10:33.370 --> 10:35.620
the strokes will vanish

10:35.620 --> 10:37.420
in a moment.

10:37.700 --> 10:39.420
So, I suspect

10:39.740 --> 10:41.060
someone tampered

10:41.060 --> 10:42.060
with my paint.

10:42.060 --> 10:43.060
Your Majesty,

10:43.060 --> 10:44.680
could you give me some clear water?

10:44.700 --> 10:46.300
Granted.

10:47.700 --> 10:49.300
Come on, pour it.

11:08.770 --> 11:10.340
Jiang Si, how dare you!

11:10.360 --> 11:12.600
Only at a national funeral
would we use black flowers.

11:12.620 --> 11:14.820
What do you mean by painting this?

11:14.830 --> 11:15.700
Come!

11:15.700 --> 11:17.510
Drag her out and cane her!

11:17.530 --> 11:18.190
Hold on.

11:18.190 --> 11:19.530
Your Majesty, please don't be mad.

11:19.530 --> 11:20.720
I did paint

11:20.740 --> 11:22.270
this black peony,

11:22.290 --> 11:24.470
but it was done

11:24.490 --> 11:25.840
with a special intention.

11:25.860 --> 11:28.230
Alright, tell me.

11:28.250 --> 11:29.990
Let me hear

11:30.010 --> 11:31.610
your special intention.

11:32.290 --> 11:33.960
Today, I didn't paint

11:33.980 --> 11:35.270
this black peony

11:35.290 --> 11:37.540
for the people present

11:37.820 --> 11:39.420
but

11:40.460 --> 11:42.250
for the late Empress.

11:42.860 --> 11:44.720
Empress Qingrong adored peonies.

11:44.740 --> 11:46.340
This is known to all.

11:46.490 --> 11:47.910
Your Majesty, you planted peonies

11:47.910 --> 11:49.130
throughout the imperial garden,

11:49.130 --> 11:52.300
presumably to express your sorrow.

11:52.770 --> 11:54.780
Empress Qingrong was compassionate

11:54.800 --> 11:56.440
and concerned
for the people's suffering.

11:56.460 --> 11:57.840
She advocated for thrift

11:57.860 --> 11:59.150
and led by example.

11:59.170 --> 12:00.510
The people all followed her.

12:00.530 --> 12:02.230
She established charity schools

12:02.250 --> 12:05.010
to support many impoverished students

12:05.130 --> 12:06.510
and founded charity workshops

12:06.530 --> 12:09.300
to treat common patients,
saving countless lives.

12:09.620 --> 12:10.700
Empress Qingrong

12:10.700 --> 12:12.800
was loved by the people of Dazhou

12:12.820 --> 12:14.220
and was the woman

12:14.220 --> 12:16.060
I most admire.

12:16.530 --> 12:18.990
Today, I named this painting

12:19.010 --> 12:21.250
Gentle Breeze

12:21.340 --> 12:22.510
because I thought

12:22.530 --> 12:23.960
Empress Qingrong

12:23.980 --> 12:25.750
was like a gentle breeze.

12:25.770 --> 12:28.200
Waters matter no more
compared to the vast sea;

12:28.220 --> 12:30.870
Clouds matter no more
compared to those in Mount Wu.

12:30.890 --> 12:32.510
Though the imperial garden

12:32.530 --> 12:34.390
is filled with bright, colorful flowers,

12:34.410 --> 12:35.750
this black peony

12:35.770 --> 12:37.580
is rare in the world,

12:38.370 --> 12:40.040
just like Empress Qingrong,

12:40.060 --> 12:41.730
who was also unique

12:42.010 --> 12:43.890
in Your Majesty's heart.

12:54.700 --> 12:56.300
How thoughtful of you.

12:57.370 --> 12:58.970
Your Majesty,

12:59.770 --> 13:01.660
the painting is good,

13:01.890 --> 13:04.940
but if it weren't for the ink,

13:05.290 --> 13:07.390
perhaps this sentiment

13:07.410 --> 13:08.960
would not have been revealed.

13:08.980 --> 13:10.390
Sun Congxin,

13:10.410 --> 13:12.040
how do you explain

13:12.060 --> 13:13.350
Jiang Si's blank scroll?

13:13.370 --> 13:17.180
I'm not aware of the ink matter.

13:17.220 --> 13:18.920
Your Majesty, please judge.

13:18.940 --> 13:22.030
All of this was arranged by you.

13:22.050 --> 13:22.890
Why is it

13:22.890 --> 13:25.180
that only Miss Jiang's ink
had a problem?

13:25.770 --> 13:27.630
Under my very eyes,

13:27.650 --> 13:29.300
how dare you be so audacious?

13:29.340 --> 13:31.230
Bring me the ink for inspection.

13:31.250 --> 13:32.850
Yes.

13:41.290 --> 13:42.240
Your Majesty.

13:42.240 --> 13:43.720
The stationery used for the contest

13:43.740 --> 13:45.350
has all been cleaned,

13:45.370 --> 13:46.780
and there's nothing left to inspect.

13:46.800 --> 13:48.630
Well, Sun Congxin.

13:48.650 --> 13:50.630
You really did a fine job.

13:50.650 --> 13:52.560
You can make a painting disappear

13:52.580 --> 13:54.660
and destroy evidence.

13:54.740 --> 13:55.890
Are you too good to stay

13:55.890 --> 13:57.230
in Rites Office?

13:57.250 --> 13:59.220
I swear it wasn't me.

13:59.220 --> 14:01.200
He tampered with things
at a royal banquet.

14:01.220 --> 14:03.110
I don't believe
he could've done it alone.

14:03.130 --> 14:04.100
Your Majesty,

14:04.100 --> 14:06.440
why not hand him over to me
for questioning?

14:06.460 --> 14:08.040
But Your Majesty,

14:08.060 --> 14:09.250
I heard

14:09.250 --> 14:12.200
that the 7th Prince and Miss Jiang

14:12.220 --> 14:13.840
have a deep relationship.

14:13.860 --> 14:16.010
He can't preside over the trial.

14:16.330 --> 14:17.650
Why not arrest Sun Congxin first

14:17.650 --> 14:18.740
and question him

14:18.740 --> 14:20.320
on another day?

14:20.340 --> 14:21.980
After all, the noble ladies of Ling'an

14:21.980 --> 14:23.600
are attending in full attire today.

14:23.620 --> 14:24.580
This matter concerns

14:24.580 --> 14:26.110
the imperial family's dignity.

14:26.130 --> 14:28.130
Your Majesty, what do you think?

14:28.290 --> 14:29.940
Rongyang makes a good point.

14:30.060 --> 14:32.540
Drag Sun Congxin out of here.

14:32.620 --> 14:33.460
Your Majesty,

14:33.460 --> 14:34.370
I'm innocent.

14:34.370 --> 14:35.150
I'm innocent!

14:35.150 --> 14:36.490
- Your Majesty...
- Your Majesty.

14:36.490 --> 14:38.440
Though this has stirred up trouble,

14:38.460 --> 14:40.230
it has also opened our eyes,

14:40.250 --> 14:41.560
and we've seen Miss Jiang's

14:41.580 --> 14:43.390
unique black peony.

14:43.410 --> 14:44.250
Why not let her enter

14:44.250 --> 14:46.040
the second round of the contest?

14:46.060 --> 14:47.660
What do you think?

14:48.740 --> 14:50.600
As Consort Zhuang suggests.

14:50.620 --> 14:51.770
Thank you, Your Majesty.

14:51.770 --> 14:54.320
Thank you, Your Majesty.
Thank you, Your Highness.

14:54.340 --> 14:55.630
What is your name?

14:55.650 --> 14:56.530
Your Majesty,

14:56.530 --> 14:58.130
I am Lan Xingwen, Deputy Rite Censor

14:58.130 --> 14:59.770
- of Rites Office.
- Good.

14:59.770 --> 15:00.860
Next,

15:00.860 --> 15:03.130
you will preside over the contest.

15:03.980 --> 15:05.580
Thank you, Your Majesty.

15:24.100 --> 15:26.270
Who would use withered wood
as decoration

15:26.290 --> 15:28.490
and pair it with flower buds?

15:28.770 --> 15:30.270
How ridiculous.

15:30.290 --> 15:32.460
Time is up.

15:34.860 --> 15:35.880
Your Majesty,

15:35.880 --> 15:38.230
this is by Kou Lingbo
from the Grand Preceptor's family.

15:38.250 --> 15:39.170
Your Majesty,

15:39.170 --> 15:40.650
my floral work is named

15:40.650 --> 15:42.370
Spring Over Stones.

15:43.770 --> 15:46.320
It is fresh and elegant. Reward.

15:46.340 --> 15:47.410
Your Majesty,

15:47.410 --> 15:49.200
this is by Princess Mingyue.

15:49.220 --> 15:52.230
My floral work is named Splendors.

15:52.250 --> 15:55.580
It indeed adds splendor to the garden.

15:57.860 --> 15:59.580
Here, on the other side,

15:59.740 --> 16:02.540
this design forms the character "Zhou".

16:02.820 --> 16:04.890
With this arrangement,

16:04.980 --> 16:07.110
I wish Your Majesty good health

16:07.130 --> 16:09.600
and prosperity for Dazhou.

16:09.620 --> 16:10.800
Marvelous.

16:10.820 --> 16:13.850
It has both form and meaning.

16:13.890 --> 16:15.230
Good.

16:15.250 --> 16:16.680
Thanks for your praise, Uncle.

16:16.700 --> 16:18.440
It's thanks to Mother's teachings.

16:18.460 --> 16:20.720
I've only learned
a fraction of her skills.

16:20.740 --> 16:22.230
Indeed.

16:22.250 --> 16:24.850
Your mother's floral artistry
is unparalleled.

16:25.220 --> 16:26.510
No one present

16:26.530 --> 16:28.300
can compare with her.

16:29.060 --> 16:31.230
Your Majesty, don't tease me.

16:31.250 --> 16:33.820
This is their banquet.

16:37.820 --> 16:38.940
Your Majesty,

16:38.940 --> 16:41.890
this is by Jiang Si
from Earl Dongping's family.

16:45.700 --> 16:48.700
Miss Jiang,
why did you choose flower buds

16:48.860 --> 16:51.580
and pair them with withered branches?

16:52.530 --> 16:53.840
Your Majesty,

16:53.860 --> 16:55.430
my floral work is called

16:55.450 --> 16:57.080
Spring amidst Trees,

16:57.100 --> 17:01.180
as in "spring amidst drying trees"
from Liu Yuxi's poem.

17:01.410 --> 17:04.140
But I see only dying trees.

17:04.450 --> 17:06.460
Where is the supposed spring?

17:06.970 --> 17:08.570
Miss Jiang,

17:09.340 --> 17:11.380
are you performing a magic trick?

17:11.860 --> 17:13.390
It is not a trick.

17:13.410 --> 17:14.800
I only thought

17:14.820 --> 17:16.100
that flowers in the garden

17:16.100 --> 17:17.350
would die soon,

17:17.370 --> 17:18.500
but these two buds

17:18.500 --> 17:20.040
haven't bloomed.

17:20.060 --> 17:21.130
I simply wish

17:21.130 --> 17:22.430
to encourage them,

17:22.450 --> 17:23.910
so they won't be lazy

17:23.930 --> 17:25.280
and will bloom quickly.

17:25.300 --> 17:26.630
If Miss Jiang

17:26.650 --> 17:28.670
can make these buds bloom,

17:28.690 --> 17:30.430
then it wouldn't be a magic trick

17:30.450 --> 17:33.630
but rather an elegant wonder.

17:33.650 --> 17:35.210
I have never heard

17:35.210 --> 17:37.840
of such a method before.

17:37.860 --> 17:40.690
Jin, do you think Miss Jiang

17:40.690 --> 17:42.390
can really make the buds bloom?

17:42.410 --> 17:44.010
I'm quite curious.

18:29.650 --> 18:31.950
Could it be the water temperature?

18:31.970 --> 18:34.380
Or was something added to the water?

18:37.540 --> 18:39.420
Miss Jiang, how remarkable.

18:39.450 --> 18:40.880
I am unworthy of such praise.

18:40.900 --> 18:42.170
I present Spring amidst Trees

18:42.170 --> 18:43.600
to both consorts,

18:43.620 --> 18:46.110
wishing you eternal youth

18:46.130 --> 18:47.710
and longevity.

18:47.730 --> 18:49.410
Making flowers bloom

18:49.410 --> 18:51.320
is truly unheard of.

18:51.340 --> 18:53.800
Miss Jiang, thank you.

18:53.820 --> 18:55.240
Miss Jiang's offering

18:55.260 --> 18:57.380
is indeed fresh and unique.

18:57.580 --> 18:59.810
To witness such an event today

18:59.970 --> 19:02.320
is truly an eye-opening experience.

19:02.340 --> 19:04.220
Sorry for my humble display.

19:05.490 --> 19:09.060
♪ Looking back,
I recall our first encounter ♪

19:09.080 --> 19:12.600
♪ Feelings remain
but things are complicated ♪

19:12.620 --> 19:15.870
♪ Thoughts replay ♪

19:16.210 --> 19:19.020
♪ I can't make up my mind ♪

19:19.040 --> 19:21.720
(Shu)

19:22.840 --> 19:26.280
(Yan)

19:26.280 --> 19:28.640
(Prince Yan)

19:30.390 --> 19:34.000
♪ Shattering the dreams ♪

19:34.020 --> 19:37.890
♪ How many petals fell, I count ♪

19:37.910 --> 19:41.510
♪ It equals the times I think about you ♪

19:42.240 --> 19:44.000
(Jiang Si)

19:48.970 --> 19:50.060
Your Highnesses,

19:50.060 --> 19:50.830
all the noble ladies

19:50.830 --> 19:52.540
have written the names
of their chosen ones

19:52.540 --> 19:53.920
and placed them inside the flowers.

19:53.930 --> 19:55.430
Now, please present the flowers

19:55.450 --> 19:57.380
to the ones you admire.

19:58.450 --> 19:59.760
Brother, please.

19:59.780 --> 20:00.620
Very well.

20:00.620 --> 20:02.940
Then I shall go first.

20:17.620 --> 20:20.100
Miss, please accept this.

20:30.060 --> 20:32.010
Jin, please.

20:40.890 --> 20:42.490
Brother,

20:42.730 --> 20:43.820
this repeated journey

20:43.820 --> 20:45.430
is tiresome.

20:45.450 --> 20:46.620
How about this?

20:46.620 --> 20:47.650
Just hold all the flowers

20:47.650 --> 20:49.250
and deliver them at once.

20:49.780 --> 20:51.780
Jin, that would not be proper.

20:51.780 --> 20:53.660
What's not proper?

20:54.340 --> 20:55.450
It's just the two of us.

20:55.450 --> 20:57.700
We're brothers. No need for that.

20:59.170 --> 21:00.770
Alright.

21:18.170 --> 21:20.600
Jin, now it's your turn.

21:20.620 --> 21:22.000
Alright.

21:28.410 --> 21:29.840
Jin, you...

21:29.860 --> 21:31.560
I don't mind the extra effort.

21:59.130 --> 22:00.860
♪ From place to place ♪

22:00.860 --> 22:05.800
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

22:06.170 --> 22:08.550
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

22:08.550 --> 22:12.780
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

22:13.490 --> 22:15.890
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

22:15.910 --> 22:19.570
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall
and take root ♪

22:19.590 --> 22:23.010
♪ Growing between us ♪

22:23.160 --> 22:28.680
♪ And breeding love ♪

22:29.500 --> 22:33.180
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

22:33.180 --> 22:37.260
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

22:37.500 --> 22:39.240
♪ Like shadows ♪

22:39.260 --> 22:43.960
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

22:43.960 --> 22:47.530
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

22:47.550 --> 22:51.780
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

22:51.800 --> 22:53.580
♪ Time glows ♪

22:53.580 --> 22:58.120
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

22:58.140 --> 23:01.840
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

23:01.860 --> 23:06.020
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

23:06.200 --> 23:07.960
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

23:07.960 --> 23:12.480
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

23:12.480 --> 23:16.120
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

23:16.140 --> 23:21.810
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

23:23.650 --> 23:25.410
Brother, good choice.

23:25.430 --> 23:32.930
♪ We will see flowers
fill the city again ♪

23:53.930 --> 23:55.530
You...

23:56.020 --> 23:57.500
How could you give all six flowers

23:57.500 --> 23:59.220
to Jiang Si?

23:59.300 --> 24:00.900
Jin.

24:01.170 --> 24:02.800
It's not I want to blame you.

24:02.820 --> 24:04.560
How can you fool around like this?

24:04.580 --> 24:05.840
You're just fooling around.

24:05.860 --> 24:07.260
This is no place for that.

24:07.260 --> 24:10.110
It's precisely because it's serious

24:10.130 --> 24:11.630
that I must treat it

24:11.650 --> 24:13.390
with the utmost caution.

24:13.410 --> 24:16.380
Father, I'm not fooling around.

24:16.890 --> 24:18.450
There are so many

24:18.450 --> 24:20.320
noble ladies present.

24:20.340 --> 24:21.820
Prince Yan gave all six flowers

24:21.820 --> 24:23.530
to one lady,

24:23.580 --> 24:25.100
which is unfair

24:25.100 --> 24:27.290
to other ladies.

24:27.370 --> 24:28.650
Fair?

24:28.650 --> 24:30.240
Aunt,

24:30.260 --> 24:32.000
there is no such thing

24:32.020 --> 24:34.330
as absolute fairness in this world.

24:34.690 --> 24:35.670
I simply want to give

24:35.670 --> 24:36.890
the flowers to Jiang Si alone.

24:36.890 --> 24:38.020
If I have to give the flowers

24:38.020 --> 24:39.170
to other ladies,

24:39.170 --> 24:40.430
that's not fair.

24:40.450 --> 24:42.110
That's just deceiving oneself.

24:42.130 --> 24:43.390
Aunt, this is too ridiculous.

24:43.410 --> 24:45.150
What's ridiculous about it?

24:45.410 --> 24:48.040
This is not a banquet for talents

24:48.060 --> 24:49.670
but a banquet to choose a wife.

24:49.690 --> 24:51.280
I'm only one man.

24:51.300 --> 24:53.080
I don't need six wives.

24:53.100 --> 24:54.870
Mother, please don't be upset.

24:56.780 --> 24:58.530
I just don't understand

24:58.860 --> 25:00.370
why you only gave the flowers

25:00.370 --> 25:02.460
to Miss Jiang.

25:03.860 --> 25:05.910
The reason is simple.

25:05.930 --> 25:06.780
There's only one.

25:06.780 --> 25:09.320
Once I laid eyes on Jiang Si,

25:09.340 --> 25:11.490
I knew she was perfect for me.

25:15.370 --> 25:18.570
How perfect.

25:19.690 --> 25:22.110
Prince Yan, you're too young

25:22.130 --> 25:23.800
to understand some things.

25:23.820 --> 25:25.650
Whether something is truly perfect

25:25.650 --> 25:27.350
is not a matter of impulse

25:27.370 --> 25:29.290
or liking someone on a whim.

25:29.730 --> 25:32.240
To be with someone for a lifetime,

25:32.260 --> 25:35.570
there are so many things to consider.

25:37.060 --> 25:39.240
But when I look

25:39.260 --> 25:40.130
at someone,

25:40.130 --> 25:42.240
I feel an unease in my heart.

25:42.260 --> 25:44.140
How can I marry her for a lifetime?

25:44.780 --> 25:45.890
Father,

25:45.890 --> 25:46.780
you and Mother

25:46.780 --> 25:49.250
promised me before

25:49.450 --> 25:51.110
that I would have

25:51.130 --> 25:53.570
my perfect wife.

25:53.730 --> 25:55.840
Now, Jiang Si is

25:55.860 --> 25:57.660
the only perfect one for me.

25:58.970 --> 25:59.820
So, you brat

25:59.820 --> 26:01.700
have already made up your mind.

26:01.870 --> 26:03.150
You've been planning every step,

26:03.170 --> 26:04.170
and now you've set up

26:04.170 --> 26:05.430
your mother and me.

26:05.450 --> 26:06.730
That's not true.

26:06.730 --> 26:09.150
This isn't about being perfect;

26:09.170 --> 26:11.410
it's about being willful.

26:11.410 --> 26:13.390
I will not approve

26:13.410 --> 26:14.900
of such a disregard for rules.

26:14.920 --> 26:16.450
You must either divide the six flowers

26:16.450 --> 26:18.760
among six ladies

26:18.780 --> 26:19.690
or wait for me

26:19.690 --> 26:22.380
to arrange your marriage.

26:23.370 --> 26:25.890
A prince does not take back

26:25.890 --> 26:27.130
what he has given.

26:27.130 --> 26:28.730
Right, Father?

26:31.540 --> 26:32.410
Your Majesty.

26:32.410 --> 26:33.410
Prince Yan...

26:33.410 --> 26:34.800
Enough, enough.

26:34.820 --> 26:36.520
It's just flowers.

26:36.540 --> 26:38.670
Why make such a fuss about it?

26:38.690 --> 26:40.630
Since the banquet is over,

26:40.650 --> 26:42.130
- everyone can leave.
- Yes.

26:42.130 --> 26:44.250
- Your Majesty.
- I'll walk you out.

26:52.170 --> 26:53.770
Alright, alright.

26:53.890 --> 26:56.050
Princes giving flowers

26:56.100 --> 26:57.770
to their future wives

26:58.260 --> 27:00.020
is merely a custom,

27:00.020 --> 27:01.660
not an explicit rule.

27:02.100 --> 27:04.570
Besides, the final decision

27:06.020 --> 27:08.530
is not for the Prince to make.

27:10.690 --> 27:12.770
Grand Princess, you're right.

27:20.500 --> 27:22.040
My dear,

27:22.060 --> 27:24.570
why make such a fuss?

27:25.410 --> 27:28.140
He's been raised in the South.

27:28.340 --> 27:30.490
I am not unsympathetic,

27:30.860 --> 27:32.130
but he cannot disregard

27:32.130 --> 27:34.460
the imperial traditions.

27:34.730 --> 27:36.330
I think

27:36.500 --> 27:39.050
Miss Jiang is good.

27:39.100 --> 27:40.520
Your Majesty...

27:40.540 --> 27:42.660
I've had it checked.

27:42.820 --> 27:45.770
The name hidden in Miss Jiang's flower

27:46.130 --> 27:47.480
is also Yu Jin,

27:47.500 --> 27:50.600
showing that the feelings are mutual.

27:50.620 --> 27:53.080
Why not grant their wish?

27:53.100 --> 27:55.000
Your Majesty, you may not know,

27:55.020 --> 27:57.410
but Miss Jiang was once rejected

27:57.410 --> 27:59.010
by the son of Duke An.

27:59.270 --> 28:00.130
That's not

28:00.130 --> 28:02.460
a big deal.

28:02.500 --> 28:03.870
The Empress of our ancestors

28:03.890 --> 28:05.840
was once married

28:05.860 --> 28:06.860
and even had two children

28:06.860 --> 28:08.710
with her ex-husband.

28:08.730 --> 28:10.630
In the end, didn't they join hands

28:10.650 --> 28:13.500
to create a prosperous dynasty

28:13.500 --> 28:15.100
and become a model couple?

28:15.540 --> 28:17.370
How can this be the same?

28:17.370 --> 28:18.670
My dear,

28:18.690 --> 28:20.600
it's to find Jin a wife,

28:20.620 --> 28:22.710
not a Crown Princess.

28:22.730 --> 28:24.320
As long as he is happy,

28:24.340 --> 28:25.970
that's good enough.

28:26.100 --> 28:27.810
To look on the bright side,

28:28.930 --> 28:30.370
having a daughter-in-law

28:30.370 --> 28:32.480
who can perform tricks to amuse you

28:32.500 --> 28:34.250
might be even more fun.

28:35.500 --> 28:37.280
I am angry

28:37.300 --> 28:38.620
because he should've told me

28:38.620 --> 28:40.870
about his plans.

28:40.890 --> 28:42.840
Instead, he disregarded me entirely.

28:42.860 --> 28:45.570
Where is his respect for me?

28:46.580 --> 28:48.150
How about this?

28:48.170 --> 28:51.380
I will ask Jin again about this.

28:56.970 --> 28:59.670
Father, Mother.

28:59.690 --> 29:00.820
Jin.

29:00.820 --> 29:03.380
As you think Miss Jiang Si is perfect,

29:03.690 --> 29:05.600
do you want to marry her?

29:05.620 --> 29:07.910
Father, how well you know me.

29:07.930 --> 29:09.970
But Miss Jiang was once rejected.

29:10.450 --> 29:12.140
You may not mind it now,

29:12.140 --> 29:13.340
but who knows about the future?

29:13.340 --> 29:14.450
If you regret it later,

29:14.450 --> 29:15.620
will you ask me

29:15.620 --> 29:17.430
to break my promise?

29:17.450 --> 29:19.040
Give me a reason

29:19.060 --> 29:21.220
why you don't mind this.

29:21.620 --> 29:24.250
The blind who missed out on treasures

29:24.410 --> 29:25.860
shouldn't stop those with good eyes

29:25.860 --> 29:27.570
from cherishing them properly.

29:29.820 --> 29:30.780
Alright then.

29:30.780 --> 29:32.690
I'll give you what you want.

29:32.690 --> 29:35.100
I'll make Jiang Si your wife.

29:35.340 --> 29:36.940
Thank you, Father.

29:37.260 --> 29:40.250
Thank you, Mother.

29:40.970 --> 29:43.110
This is the wife you chose yourself.

29:43.130 --> 29:45.290
The future

29:45.620 --> 29:47.330
is entirely up to you.

29:54.930 --> 29:56.520
Mother, don't worry.

29:56.540 --> 29:58.110
I will make sure I am happy.

29:58.130 --> 29:59.320
Leave now.

29:59.340 --> 30:01.220
I take my leave.

30:07.170 --> 30:09.040
Look at how happy he is.

30:09.060 --> 30:12.010
This boy is so simple-minded.

30:12.340 --> 30:13.860
He can't hold back his emotions.

30:13.860 --> 30:16.530
I've always been thinking of him,

30:17.690 --> 30:19.940
but now I'm the bad person.

30:20.210 --> 30:21.900
My dear, you're overthinking.

30:23.020 --> 30:24.630
As for his marriage,

30:24.650 --> 30:27.220
I hope you will manage it carefully.

30:27.780 --> 30:29.260
In time, he will understand

30:29.260 --> 30:30.840
your good intentions.

30:30.860 --> 30:32.460
I...

30:36.410 --> 30:38.010
My dear, please stay.

30:48.100 --> 30:50.040
Yu Jin is

30:50.060 --> 30:51.390
such a fool.

30:51.410 --> 30:53.870
Even though he does like her,

30:53.890 --> 30:55.870
can't he at least hide it?

30:55.890 --> 30:58.220
Prince Yan's thoughts are pure,

30:58.260 --> 31:01.570
and he's in his prime,

31:02.060 --> 31:04.970
so it's only natural
that his true feelings show.

31:07.620 --> 31:08.950
Good.

31:08.970 --> 31:11.530
Giving all six flowers to one lady

31:11.650 --> 31:13.800
is something I wanted to do

31:13.820 --> 31:15.700
but I didn't dare.

31:18.880 --> 31:20.840
(Earl Dongping's Mansion)

31:20.860 --> 31:22.460
Si,

31:22.540 --> 31:24.320
did you really receive

31:24.340 --> 31:26.460
all six flowers at yesterday's banquet?

31:27.730 --> 31:30.180
What an honor to our family.

31:31.170 --> 31:34.220
Who gave them to you?

31:35.930 --> 31:36.820
Prince Yan.

31:36.820 --> 31:38.420
And?

31:40.410 --> 31:41.630
That's it.

31:41.650 --> 31:43.420
It was all from Prince Yan.

31:49.620 --> 31:51.620
Oh, no.

31:52.060 --> 31:53.860
Grandmother, what do you mean?

31:53.860 --> 31:56.060
The tall tree is bound
to be struck by the wind.

31:56.060 --> 31:58.080
Don't you understand that?

31:58.100 --> 31:59.690
By showing off like this,

31:59.690 --> 32:01.110
you'll inevitably be hated,

32:01.130 --> 32:02.800
and our family

32:02.820 --> 32:04.840
will be dragged down.

32:04.860 --> 32:06.460
Mother.

32:06.680 --> 32:07.580
Mother.

32:07.580 --> 32:09.180
What is it? Tell me.

32:09.860 --> 32:11.460
Mother,

32:13.130 --> 32:15.220
everyone is talking

32:15.620 --> 32:17.350
about Miss Si.

32:17.370 --> 32:18.840
They say she's a disaster,

32:18.860 --> 32:20.670
and the Palace won't admit

32:20.690 --> 32:23.560
the flowers she received.

32:23.580 --> 32:25.480
They say if our girls

32:25.500 --> 32:27.320
want to marry a Prince,

32:27.340 --> 32:28.940
it'll only be a fantasy.

32:31.340 --> 32:32.540
Si, listen.

32:32.540 --> 32:35.300
Listen to what they're saying about you.

32:35.300 --> 32:38.970
You're too young

32:39.410 --> 32:41.390
to know how to conceal your brilliance.

32:41.410 --> 32:42.930
Sometimes, you need to hold back.

32:42.930 --> 32:44.460
You must understand this principle.

32:44.480 --> 32:46.040
Everyone should maintain their dignity,

32:46.060 --> 32:48.620
so you can meet them in the future.

32:50.100 --> 32:51.520
Grandmother, you're right.

32:51.540 --> 32:52.690
As for other matters,

32:52.690 --> 32:54.480
I'll follow the rules.

32:54.500 --> 32:56.290
But I find it hard

32:57.060 --> 32:58.900
to give up my marriage.

32:59.300 --> 33:00.820
Think carefully.

33:00.820 --> 33:02.210
If this marriage succeeds,

33:02.210 --> 33:03.500
it'll be perfect.

33:03.500 --> 33:04.620
But if it doesn't,

33:04.620 --> 33:05.930
how will our family

33:05.930 --> 33:08.460
be able to hold our heads up?

33:10.340 --> 33:11.940
Alright.

33:12.340 --> 33:13.910
Stay in your chamber

33:13.930 --> 33:16.060
for the time being.

33:16.060 --> 33:17.170
Reflect on your actions,

33:17.170 --> 33:19.330
restrain your temper,

33:19.860 --> 33:21.060
and don't let others think

33:21.060 --> 33:22.540
that our family

33:22.540 --> 33:24.220
lacks propriety.

33:27.020 --> 33:28.620
Yes.

33:30.020 --> 33:31.620
I take my leave.

33:33.730 --> 33:35.080
Mother, calm down.

33:35.100 --> 33:36.020
Calm down.

33:36.020 --> 33:37.630
Here's what I'm thinking.

33:37.650 --> 33:40.320
If she really marries a Prince,

33:40.340 --> 33:41.410
I would be happy for her.

33:41.410 --> 33:43.760
I hope the girls marry well.

33:43.780 --> 33:45.380
But

33:45.580 --> 33:47.860
noble families are fraught with dangers.

33:47.860 --> 33:50.220
Yes, you're right.

33:50.930 --> 33:51.890
Who would have thought

33:51.890 --> 33:54.830
that Commandant Yu is Prince Yan?

33:54.850 --> 33:55.690
Since Si

33:55.690 --> 33:57.750
got involved with Prince Yan,

33:57.770 --> 34:00.060
she's been reckless and unrestrained.

34:01.690 --> 34:03.290
Mother, calm down.

34:10.020 --> 34:11.170
Didn't I say it before?

34:11.170 --> 34:12.650
She's not suitable to marry a Prince.

34:12.650 --> 34:14.290
You're going to ruin her.

34:14.540 --> 34:16.600
Mingyue likes the 7th Prince.

34:16.620 --> 34:18.540
What can I do?

34:18.770 --> 34:20.090
Well then.

34:20.110 --> 34:21.460
Now, all the 7th Prince's flowers

34:21.460 --> 34:22.650
went to Jiang Si.

34:22.650 --> 34:24.020
Mingyue saw it herself.

34:24.020 --> 34:25.190
She'll give up now, right?

34:25.210 --> 34:27.220
What's the big deal about that?

34:27.730 --> 34:29.170
I arranged the banquet

34:29.170 --> 34:30.710
with great care,

34:30.730 --> 34:34.100
but Jiang Si completely avoided it.

34:34.620 --> 34:36.040
What a pity.

34:36.060 --> 34:38.290
She almost got caned.

34:40.770 --> 34:43.100
As expected of Su Ke's daughter.

34:43.420 --> 34:45.020
Like her mother,

34:45.250 --> 34:47.370
she's a beauty who brings disaster.

34:50.250 --> 34:51.850
What?

34:52.300 --> 34:53.620
Is it not enough that you broke up

34:53.620 --> 34:55.830
my relationship with Su Ke back then?

34:55.850 --> 34:57.380
Now, you want Mingyue

34:57.380 --> 34:59.360
to steal love from her daughter?

34:59.380 --> 35:01.480
Is Mingyue your daughter,

35:01.500 --> 35:04.250
or is Jiang Si your daughter?

35:04.250 --> 35:05.710
Stop this nonsense.

35:05.730 --> 35:06.730
Feeling guilty now?

35:06.730 --> 35:08.660
I've hit the nail on the head?

35:12.250 --> 35:13.940
No wonder there are rumors

35:13.940 --> 35:16.380
about you and Su Ke being close

35:16.380 --> 35:18.580
and losing your innocence long ago.

35:19.380 --> 35:22.180
I guess it's true.

35:22.580 --> 35:24.180
Rongyang,

35:24.940 --> 35:27.370
don't push it.

35:27.810 --> 35:31.220
There was nothing between Su Ke and me.

35:31.330 --> 35:33.170
She's been dead for years.

35:33.170 --> 35:35.060
Why still slander her name?

35:35.170 --> 35:36.850
How malicious of you!

35:36.940 --> 35:38.190
Shut up!

35:38.210 --> 35:40.600
How can you say that about me
for a dead woman?

35:46.520 --> 35:48.880
(Luxurious and Gorgeous)

35:55.380 --> 35:56.250
Beautiful.

35:56.250 --> 35:57.850
So beautiful.

35:58.100 --> 36:00.250
These flowers are as beautiful as you.

36:02.940 --> 36:04.540
Your Grace.

36:10.700 --> 36:12.900
- Please forgive us.
- Please forgive us.

36:19.770 --> 36:21.500
Raise your head.

36:29.690 --> 36:32.190
Your Grace, please spare us.

36:32.210 --> 36:34.660
- Please spare us.
- Please spare us.

36:36.020 --> 36:37.620
Bring the fire.

37:07.420 --> 37:09.020
Mother.

37:13.730 --> 37:15.330
Mingyue,

37:16.850 --> 37:19.580
if a man's heart is elsewhere,

37:19.900 --> 37:22.290
no matter how good he is,

37:22.620 --> 37:24.790
what does it matter to you?

37:24.810 --> 37:26.130
But I've seen

37:26.130 --> 37:27.890
how good he is.

37:30.500 --> 37:32.100
If I can't have him,

37:32.330 --> 37:36.580
I won't die in peace.

37:36.770 --> 37:38.370
Some things,

37:38.900 --> 37:40.770
even if forced,

37:40.980 --> 37:43.100
may not go as wished.

37:43.580 --> 37:45.180
But Mother,

37:45.940 --> 37:47.810
if you had another chance,

37:48.650 --> 37:49.580
you would still

37:49.580 --> 37:51.150
choose the same, right?

37:51.170 --> 37:52.790
If I don't fight,

37:52.810 --> 37:54.620
how can I let it go willingly?

37:58.060 --> 38:00.660
Mother, please believe me.

38:01.460 --> 38:03.620
I will have a different ending.

38:06.940 --> 38:09.140
Perhaps I can achieve

38:10.770 --> 38:12.620
what you couldn't.

38:18.280 --> 38:22.880
(Chengtian Hall)

38:38.850 --> 38:40.580
Greetings, Your Highness.

38:41.730 --> 38:42.810
General Cui,

38:42.810 --> 38:45.400
thank you for saving me.

38:45.420 --> 38:47.370
It's my duty.

38:55.100 --> 38:57.160
Greetings, Your Majesty.

38:57.180 --> 38:58.170
Your Majesty,

38:58.170 --> 39:00.960
the rebellion has been crushed,

39:00.980 --> 39:03.150
with seven cities reclaimed
and 3,000 captured.

39:03.170 --> 39:04.400
Good.

39:04.420 --> 39:06.560
General Cui is unstoppable.

39:06.580 --> 39:08.150
I will reward you greatly.

39:08.170 --> 39:09.500
I shall let you marry

39:09.500 --> 39:11.630
Grand Princess Rongyang, my only sister.

39:11.650 --> 39:13.250
What do you think?

39:13.290 --> 39:14.890
Thank you, Your Majesty,

39:15.020 --> 39:16.110
but I am already engaged

39:16.130 --> 39:18.130
and do not wish to marry anyone else.

39:34.210 --> 39:35.810
Very well.

39:37.100 --> 39:40.660
I will let you marry him.

39:56.100 --> 39:56.940
Lady Jiang,

39:56.940 --> 39:58.170
why would the Palace

39:58.170 --> 40:00.140
suddenly issue an edict?

40:00.210 --> 40:01.900
I think it's because Si

40:01.900 --> 40:02.810
stole the show

40:02.810 --> 40:04.630
at the banquet.

40:04.650 --> 40:06.700
Especially with the 7th Prince.

40:06.810 --> 40:08.380
Who knows

40:08.380 --> 40:09.940
what storm will come?

40:09.940 --> 40:11.980
Lady Jiang is here.

40:17.850 --> 40:20.250
His Majesty has ordered:

40:22.420 --> 40:24.480
Jiang Si, daughter of Earl Dongping,

40:24.500 --> 40:25.650
is virtuous

40:25.650 --> 40:27.230
and graceful.

40:27.250 --> 40:29.360
I am pleased.

40:29.380 --> 40:30.850
The 7th Prince, Jin,

40:30.850 --> 40:32.670
is at a marriageable age,

40:32.690 --> 40:34.710
and a virtuous match is needed.

40:34.730 --> 40:35.770
Thus, I betroth Jiang Si

40:35.770 --> 40:37.960
to the 7th Prince.

40:37.980 --> 40:40.100
They shall marry at a good time.

40:40.290 --> 40:42.250
The authorities shall carry it out.

40:42.730 --> 40:43.650
Thank

40:43.650 --> 40:45.290
His Majesty.

40:50.210 --> 40:51.250
Miss Jiang Si,

40:51.250 --> 40:52.850
accept the edict.

41:00.290 --> 41:01.670
Congratulations, Miss Jiang Si.

41:01.690 --> 41:03.290
Thank you.

41:04.130 --> 41:06.250
Goodbye, Eunuch.

41:10.940 --> 41:12.230
Grandmother.

41:12.250 --> 41:13.480
Si.

41:13.500 --> 41:19.700
Congratulations, Miss Si.

41:19.980 --> 41:22.330
Aunt, are you going to be a Princess?

41:22.350 --> 41:25.130
(Jiang Si from Earl Dongping's family)
Will you move to a big house?

41:25.130 --> 41:27.670
I want to go with you.

41:27.690 --> 41:29.130
Okay. You can go anywhere

41:29.130 --> 41:30.880
I go, okay?

41:30.900 --> 41:32.060
Si.

41:32.060 --> 41:33.660
Congratulations.

41:33.730 --> 41:34.920
Congratulations, Miss.

41:34.940 --> 41:36.360
Congratulations, Princess Yan.

41:36.380 --> 41:38.560
May all your wishes come true.

41:38.580 --> 41:40.110
Congratulations, Si.

41:40.130 --> 41:41.520
Here.

41:41.540 --> 41:42.690
Take it.

41:42.690 --> 41:44.290
Si,

41:44.650 --> 41:47.890
the imperial family's status
is unmatched.

41:48.130 --> 41:49.620
Now, our family

41:49.620 --> 41:52.100
has support

41:52.170 --> 41:53.750
in the Palace.

41:53.770 --> 41:55.450
Our family

41:56.170 --> 41:57.630
will only thrive

41:57.650 --> 41:59.890
in the future.

42:00.330 --> 42:01.420
You grew up

42:01.420 --> 42:03.480
in this mansion.

42:03.500 --> 42:04.920
I have always believed

42:04.940 --> 42:07.370
you are blessed.

42:10.170 --> 42:12.560
Prince Yan is noble,

42:12.580 --> 42:15.140
and you like each other.

42:16.330 --> 42:18.270
I bless you both

42:18.290 --> 42:20.000
to live in harmony.

42:20.020 --> 42:21.360
Grandmother, you flatter me.

42:21.380 --> 42:23.000
It is thanks to the family's teachings.

42:23.020 --> 42:24.480
Since you'll marry a Prince,

42:24.500 --> 42:26.600
your dowry must be fitting.

42:26.620 --> 42:27.460
I have the jewelry

42:27.460 --> 42:29.750
you'll need for your wedding.

42:29.770 --> 42:32.500
Come on, let's choose your jewelry.

42:32.500 --> 42:34.110
- Sure. Let's go, Yan.
- Let's go.

42:34.130 --> 42:36.180
I can choose for Aunt.

42:36.250 --> 42:37.850
Sure.

42:41.420 --> 42:42.920
They've left.

42:42.980 --> 42:44.710
What did

42:44.730 --> 42:45.900
that eunuch say?

42:45.900 --> 42:47.930
He said she'd be Princess Yan.

42:56.690 --> 42:59.500
So, she's truly flying high.

43:00.100 --> 43:02.200
My daughter was virtuous,

43:02.220 --> 43:03.290
yet she married Cao Xingyu,

43:03.290 --> 43:04.920
a cruel man.

43:04.940 --> 43:06.810
How lucky she is.

43:06.850 --> 43:08.360
In a blink,

43:08.380 --> 43:10.250
she's become Princess Yan!

43:14.600 --> 43:18.720
(The End of Episode 27)

43:19.330 --> 43:21.060
♪ From place to place ♪

43:21.060 --> 43:26.000
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:26.370 --> 43:28.750
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:28.750 --> 43:32.980
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:33.690 --> 43:36.090
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:36.110 --> 43:39.770
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:39.790 --> 43:43.210
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:43.360 --> 43:48.880
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:49.700 --> 43:53.380
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:53.380 --> 43:57.460
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:57.700 --> 43:59.440
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:59.460 --> 44:04.160
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

44:04.160 --> 44:07.730
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:07.750 --> 44:11.980
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:12.000 --> 44:13.780
♪ Time glows ♪

44:13.780 --> 44:18.320
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:18.340 --> 44:23.140
♪ And stars ♪

44:27.370 --> 44:29.900
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:29.920 --> 44:33.540
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:33.560 --> 44:36.990
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:37.010 --> 44:41.630
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:41.630 --> 44:45.320
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:45.340 --> 44:49.430
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:49.540 --> 44:51.360
♪ Time glows ♪

44:51.360 --> 44:55.910
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:55.930 --> 44:59.630
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:59.650 --> 45:03.810
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

45:03.990 --> 45:05.750
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

45:05.750 --> 45:10.270
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

45:10.270 --> 45:13.910
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

45:13.930 --> 45:19.600
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

45:21.290 --> 45:23.220
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

45:23.220 --> 45:30.720
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
